{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09981","headline":"东溪待苏户曹不至 · 张万顷","name":"东溪待苏户曹不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳城东伊水西，千花万竹使人迷。\n台上柳枝临岸低，门前荷叶与桥齐。\n日暮待君君不见，长风吹雨过青溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张万顷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}